                    "adopts the field's own names — plasmid (was 'stick') / "
                    "nuclear (was 'minted'); genome.set_type_aliases / "
                    "load_type_aliases_toml re-present the old names (a "
                    "pure Python layer; the C output stays canonical). "
                    "srmech reads the SHAPE (the inline cap markers); the "
