                    "THE SUBJECT IS VALIDATED BEFORE IT IS WRAPPED and the "
                    "RESULT IS VALIDATED AFTER, so this op can never mint a "
                    "body a reader would refuse: arity >= 1 is enforced "
                    "here rather than discovered later, and wrapping a "
                    "strand already nested to MAX_GROUP_DEPTH (32) raises "
