                    "OBJECT THAT NEVER GROUPS WRITES ZERO EXTRA BYTES and "
                    "is BYTE-IDENTICAL to v19 — only the manifest "
                    "format_version moves (19 -> 20). What breaks is the "
                    "other direction, deliberately: a v19 reader meets 0x5B "
