                    "(the precondition stage-2 conservation reads); a "
                    "shared VOCAB chromosome (the karyotype index) records "
                    "the global word->id table. The heavy per-section "
                    "compute (graph_kernel_encode -> the §89 KERNEL-region "
                    "build -> genome_append) rides the ONE bare-C "
                    "orchestrator srmech_genome_plasmid_extract when "
