                    "stage-1 end-to-end as cooccurrence_topk -> "
                    "plasmid_extract, zero Python); the pure body "
                    "(_graph_kernel_encode + genome_append_kernel) is the "
                    "numpy-free alternative + BYTE-PARITY oracle (the "
                    "section turns.bin is byte-identical whether native or "
                    "pure). §101: an in-process progress= callable (a "
                    "Python-only kwarg, NOT an MCP wire parameter — a "
                    "callable cannot cross JSON-RPC) fires between whole "
                    "SECTIONS with phase EXTRACTING (done=sections so far, "
                    "total=n docs); a truthy return CANCELS cleanly, "
