                    "Keystones: Δ=(E₄³−E₆²)/1728 at weight 12 → "
                    "{(3,0):1/1728,(0,2):−1/1728}; E₈ → {(2,0):1}; E₁₀ → "
                    "{(1,1):1}; E₁₄ → {(2,1):1}. ≥ dim(k)+2 terms required. "
                    "1:1 C peer srmech_modular_forms_ring_represent "
                    "(dispatches the square subsystem to srmech_qmat_solve; "
                    "native when present, pure-Python the complete "
