        # ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
        # The q-HYPERGEOMETRIC row of the §76 telescope Σ-row prover (F929) —
        # q-Gosper, the FIRST public op of the q-row (the q-analog of gosper).
        # Decides q-Gosper-summability of a q-hypergeometric term over the rc54
