                    "F(n+j,k)=Δ_q(R·F) holds exactly), or None when no "
                    "recurrence of order ≤ max_order exists. Exact over the "
                    "FIELD ℚ(q) via the PARAMETRIZED rc55 q-Gosper "
                    "undetermined-coefficient solve (reuses the q-Gosper "
                    "_Cq ℚ(q) field + Gauss-Jordan with the a_j(qⁿ) as "
