                    "arXiv:math/0105155 §3.1 (the octonionic Hopf fibration "
                    "S⁷↪S¹⁵↠S⁸, 𝕆P¹≅S⁸); Springer & Veldkamp (2000) ch. 5. "
                    "ATTESTATION FIX rc428 (`#T1126`): this said §4.1–§4.2 "
