                              "'gen': str, 'n': int, 'period': str}. The "
                              "comma is exact at EVERY n; only the Class-J "
                              "enrichment (limit / monzo) is bounded, because "
                              "factor binds the fixed-width srmech_factor and "
                              "refuses an operand beyond 2**64 - 1. A long "
